@startuml sequence_stream
title Streaming Output Flow (Server-Sent Events)
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam noteBorderColor #999999

actor "Client" as Client
participant "FastAPI" as API
participant "TaskStorage" as Store
participant "OutputBuffer" as Buffer

== Phase 1: Establish SSE Connection ==

Client -> API : GET /tasks/{id}/stream
activate API

note right of Client
  **Client-side Usage**
  const es = new EventSource(url);
  es.onmessage = (e) => ...;
  es.addEventListener('status', ...);
end note

API -> Store : get(task_id)
Store --> API : Task

alt Task Not Found
    API --> Client : 404 Not Found
else Task Exists
    note right of API
      **Response Headers**
      Content-Type: text/event-stream
      Cache-Control: no-cache
      Connection: keep-alive
    end note
    API --> Client : HTTP 200 OK + SSE headers
end

== Phase 2: Stream Loop ==

loop While task is PENDING or RUNNING

    API -> Buffer : get_output_buffer(task_id)
    Buffer --> API : new lines since last_index

    note right of Buffer
      **Incremental Reading**
      Track last_index to avoid
      sending duplicate output
    end note

    alt New output available
        API --> Client : data: {line}
    end

    API -> API : asyncio.sleep(0.1)

    API -> Store : get(task_id)
    Store --> API : Task (updated status)

end

== Phase 3: Task Completion ==

API --> Client : event: status / data: {status}

note right of API
  Task status changed to:
  COMPLETED, FAILED,
  TIMEOUT, or KILLED
end note

opt Error message exists
    API --> Client : event: error / data: {message}
end

API --> Client : event: done / data: finished

deactivate API

note right of Client
  **SSE Event Format**
  data: hello world
  event: status / data: completed
  event: error / data: ZeroDivisionError
  event: done / data: finished
end note

note right of Store
  **Error Scenarios**
  1. Task Not Found: 404
  2. Already Completed: send done
  3. Client Disconnects: task continues
  4. Timeout: send error event
end note

@enduml
